{"2941960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Depths of Despair", "steam_appid": 2941960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depths of Despair is a solo/group survivors-like, roguelite game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against waves of monsters and bosses for 10-20 minutes, unlock multiple abilities and upgrade them. You have the option to aim abilities with your cursor or let them aim the closest enemy automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play solo or up to 4 players by hosting games online or via LAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Note; The friend with the best internet should do the hosting for better experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect gold and unlock new characters with new starting abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Set new records on leaderboard and unlock achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 game modes! Normal mode &amp; Defend the church</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depths of Despair is a solo/group survivors-like, roguelite game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against waves of monsters and bosses for 10-20 minutes, unlock multiple abilities and upgrade them. You have the option to aim abilities with your cursor or let them aim the closest enemy automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play solo or up to 4 players by hosting games online or via LAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Note; The friend with the best internet should do the hosting for better experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect gold and unlock new characters with new starting abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Set new records on leader